' plantuml-version: 1.2026.8
@startuml 03-logical-state-booking
title Estados de uma reserva (D-BOOKING) · Booking.Status

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #1168BD
  ArrowColor #555555
}

state Confirmed : confirmada\nocupa o slot (bookings_no_overlap)
state CancelledByPlayer : cancelada pelo jogador\nCancelledAt
state CancelledByClub : cancelada pelo clube\nCancelledAt, CancellationReason
state NoShow : falta\nnão ocupa o slot

[*] --> Confirmed : Booking.ForPlayer(…)\n(BookingService, RecurringBookingService)\nBooking.ForCustomer(…)\n(ClubBookingService.CreateAsync)
Confirmed --> CancelledByPlayer : CancelByPlayer(window, now)\n[now < StartsAt − janela atual do clube]\nBookingCancellationService, sob CC-LOCK
Confirmed --> CancelledByClub : CancelByClub(reason, now)\n[ainda não começou]\nClubBookingService.CancelAsync, sob CC-LOCK
Confirmed --> NoShow : RecordNoShow(now)\n[now ≥ EndsAt]\nClubBookingService.MarkNoShowAsync, sob CC-LOCK
NoShow --> Confirmed : UndoNoShow()\n[a constraint aceita; 23P01 → 409 slot_taken]\nClubBookingService.UndoNoShowAsync, sob CC-LOCK

note right of CancelledByPlayer
  Os dois cancelamentos são finais:
  nenhum método sai deles.
  A reserva nunca é apagada.
end note

note bottom of Confirmed
  Recusas (o estado não muda):
  CancelByPlayer → NotConfirmed (422 booking_not_confirmed),
    OutsideWindow (422 outside_cancellation_window)
  CancelByClub → NotConfirmed (422), AlreadyStarted (422 booking_already_started)
  RecordNoShow → NotConfirmed (422), NotEnded (422 booking_not_ended)
  UndoNoShow → false (422 booking_not_no_show)
end note

@enduml
